{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in over 90 minutes of elemental music by Aleksandria Migova. From lush forest themes, to watery waltzes, to grungy industrial fiery percussion, this original soundtrack was designed specifically for thinking and flow state, no matter the context.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This soundtrack, like the game, is an active work in progress. Any future additions or revisions will be included with this purchase. Thank you for supporting independent composers!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849110?t=1751533409","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849110?t=1751533409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849110/1a8d9a777dd62798f9098ce4bf7e6dd1ac893fc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751533409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849110/1a8d9a777dd62798f9098ce4bf7e6dd1ac893fc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751533409","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in over 90 minutes of elemental music by Aleksandria Migova. From lush forest themes, to watery waltzes, to grungy industrial fiery percussion, this original soundtrack was designed specifically for thinking and flow state, no matter the context.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This soundtrack, like the game, is an active work in progress. Any future additions or revisions will be included with this purchase. Thank you for supporting independent composers!</p>","developers":["CyanAvatar Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3320980","name":"MoteMancer"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849110/c8a37cf83860bed065393ae3e82e493ed8bdf346/header.jpg?t=1751533409","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requ